---
description: Git commit messages default to English in quantFinance
globs:
  - "**/*"
alwaysApply: true
---

# Commits (quantFinance)

Use **English** for commit **subject and body** by default. Reserve other languages for exceptional cases (e.g. product names or quoted errors).

- Subject: imperative mood, ~50–72 characters, one line; optional body with bullets for what/why.
- If the same change is user-facing, you may add a one-line 中文说明 in the PR, but the **git** message stays English.
